[# email/legal-disclaimer: small print such as offer terms, price disclaimers or regulatory text.

   Kept at 12px or above (the caption type level) so it stays legible. Long text is fine, it wraps.

   Compatibility
   - Outlook desktop: honored.
   - Gmail apps: fine.
   - Dark mode: the text swaps via dm-muted where prefers-color-scheme is honored. #]
<mj-text[[ cc('dm-muted' if s.darkMode, cls) ]] align="[[ s.align ]]" [[ typo('caption', { color: s.color }) ]] padding="[[ s.padding ]]">[% if s.prefix %][[ s.prefix ]] [% endif %][[ data.text ]]</mj-text>
